1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,776
September 8th, 2025.

2
00:00:01,776 --> 00:00:07,459
npm maintainer qix was phished, and nineteen of his packages shipped malware.

3
00:00:07,459 --> 00:00:08,271
Are we hit?

4
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:15,674
Every chain is a multi-hop traversal in FalkorDB, with an npm semver check on the last edge.

5
00:00:15,674 --> 00:00:21,965
Honest negatives: checkout-api reaches debug, but its range rules the bad version out.

6
00:00:21,965 --> 00:00:24,526
Direct dependencies alone find one.

7
00:00:24,526 --> 00:00:26,355
Depth is the whole story.

8
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,668
Four deterministic specialists.

9
00:00:29,668 --> 00:00:39,335
Each reads its inputs back from the graph, and every finding and handoff is a node or edge in FalkorDB, so this run replays from a link.

10
00:00:39,335 --> 00:00:41,382
Pages are drafts, never sent.

11
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:44,247
Sessions live in the graph too.

12
00:00:44,247 --> 00:00:51,414
A follow-up resolves against earlier turns, and asking who to wake gives the teams and on-call people first.

13
00:00:56,860 --> 00:01:03,944
It writes the incident into FalkorDB, I approve the plan as a playbook, and the next time it answers from graph memory.

14
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:10,549
Each tenant is its own graph.

15
00:01:10,549 --> 00:01:14,162
Globex is hit by Shai-Hulud, and Acme is not.

16
00:01:14,162 --> 00:01:18,820
Nothing from Acme's memory or sessions shows up in Globex.

17
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:33,100
A real feed: npm malware advisories from OSV, checked against every tenant within one poll.

18
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:37,154
This button replays a past advisory, labelled as a replay.

19
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,930
Every answer is traced: each MCP call, then parameterised Cypher, never generated from your text.

20
00:01:44,930 --> 00:01:51,502
The benchmark runs in process on synthetic writes; over HTTP, about fifty requests a second.

21
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:56,939
Deterministic first, every answer traced, memory in the graph.

22
00:01:56,939 --> 00:01:57,860
PatientZero.
